UID:de919319dbb74d58d7d66df7a1d3977f@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:LBF is a Washington D.C. band which specializes in Latin\, Blu
 es and Funk music. Members of LBF have appeared with groups such as the Oh
 io Players\, George Duke\, El Gran Combo\, Willie Colon\, Horace Silver\, 
 Ray Barretto\, and Young and Rollins. They have also played with local sal
 sa bands such as Peligro\, Tentacion\, Sin Miedo\, Alfredo Mojica and Frie
 nds\, and Tumbao. https://www.latinbluesfunk.com/
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/latin-blues-funk-2/
